                                                "text": "2001, Rachel Webster, XHTML Simplified, A.D.R. (London) Limited, →ISBN, page 113,\nThe next requirement is to strikethrough, “Yoga is just massage.\nInline style element <strike> carries out this task easily. It strikes through text."
